  "prefLabel": "He-W 803.02 Individual Responsibility to Supply Accurate Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 803.02 Individual Responsibility to Supply Accurate Information. Individuals shall supply complete and truthful answers to all written and verbal questions to establish eligibility or fulfill an eligibility requirement, pursuant to RSA 167:17-b.\n\nSource. #11042, eff 2-24-16; ss by #14634, eff 6-26-26, EXPIRES: 6-26-36",
